# Links lychee should not verify.
#
#
# The demo gallery used to be listed here. The gifs are build artifacts
# attached to each release by goreleaser, so the README links them as
# releases/latest/download/<name>.gif — which 404'd until a release actually
# carried them. v0.2.19 ships all fourteen, so the links resolve and a broken
# gallery image is a real CI failure again.

# contributor-covenant.org TCP-resets link checkers run from GitHub-hosted
# runners (curl/hyper "connection reset by peer", os error 104) no matter the
# user agent; the canonical Code of Conduct URL renders fine in a browser.
# Re-check occasionally and drop this line when the host stops blocking.
https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/
